        "comet_sections": {
          "content": {
            "story": {
              "post_id": "122123185335379375",
              "message": {
                "text": "⭐ Sweet Real Feedback From Our Kickstarter Backers! ⭐ Part Two\n\nStill on the fence about getting a Riko for your furry baby? Check out the sweet feedback from our early Kickstarter supporters—swipe through the images to read their stories! 😻\n\nCouldn't feel more about the love and excitement from pet parents, agree? 🐱 Well, here's even better news—Riko is now officially available on our website, and our pre-sale deals are not to be missed!\n\n📅 Aug 17–31 → Early bird price at $219.99**\n💸 Stack an extra 5% off → use code **PH5RIKO**\n🎁 And here's the fun part → once you get your Riko, snap a pic or reel (bonus points if your cat photobombs!), and you could win a **$100 gift card! → check out our other pinned post for details\n\n🔗 Grab your Riko feeder 👉 dada.link/7XZt4i\n\n#NeakasaRiko #SmartPetFeeder #RealUserReviews #CatLovers  #cleanhome"
              },
